#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-1-full-history-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "The library SHALL build the ITI-YY5 Retrieve Manifest request from a VHL payload: POST to <base>/List/_search (accepting a manifest URL of either the List?... or the List/_search?... form), Content-Type application/x-www-form-urlencoded, body holding the manifest URL's search parameters (_id, code, status and patient.identifier required; _include=List:item optional) plus recipient (required), passcode (required when, and only when, the payload's flag has P) and embeddedLengthMax (optional). It SHALL refuse a payload whose URL lacks a required parameter. Sending the request is the host's."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-0-one-family-one-phone/index.html:0
msgid "The library SHALL generate a VHL key as 32 bytes from the platform's cryptographically secure random generator, encoded as 43 base64url characters."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "The library SHALL implement signing and verification for ES256 (alg -7, ECDSA P-256 with SHA-256) and PS256 (alg -37, RSASSA-PSS with SHA-256, MGF1 SHA-256, salt length 32, modulus at least 2048 bits)."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-0-one-family-one-phone/index.html:0
msgid "The library SHALL model the VHL payload as the SMART Health Links payload format that IHE VHL reuses: url (required, https), key (required, 43 base64url characters encoding 32 bytes), exp (optional integer, epoch seconds), flag (optional; the letters L and P in alphabetical order), label (optional, at most 80 characters), v (optional integer, default 1) and extension.fhirBaseUrl (optional). Validation SHALL report each violation. The single-file U flag is out of scope and SHALL be reported as unsupported."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "The library SHALL provide a typed DVCMin payload with the short element names and cardinalities of the logical model: n 1..1, dob 1..1, s 1..1, nt 1..1, id 0..1, dt 0..1, gn 0..1, vx 1..1, v 1..1, and a PayloadCodec for it."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "The library SHALL provide the vx structure with vp 1..1, dv 1..1, cn 0..1, is 0..1 and bo 1..1."
msgstr ""

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-1-full-history-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "The library SHALL read the ITI-YY5 response, a FHIR searchset Bundle: the List with search.mode match and, when the Include DocumentReference option was used, the DocumentReferences with search.mode include. For each document it SHALL return the attachment URL and the decrypted content type (attachment.contentType); for List items whose DocumentReference is not included it SHALL return the reference for the host to read."
msgstr ""

